pchar_errors.pas:46:9: error: cannot assign a String value to a PChar variable
   p := s;
        ^

pchar_errors.pas:39:9: error: this keeps a PChar into a Char array, which Ruscal can't do (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#pchar-into-array
   p := buf;
        ^^^

pchar_errors.pas:40:9: error: this keeps a PChar into a Char array, which Ruscal can't do (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#pchar-into-array
   p := StrScan(buf, 'a');
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

pchar_errors.pas:41:9: error: this keeps a PChar into a Char array, which Ruscal can't do (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#pchar-into-array
   p := Echo(buf);
        ^^^^^^^^^

pchar_errors.pas:42:9: error: `Keep` keeps this PChar after it returns, which Ruscal can't do for a Char array (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#pchar-into-array
   Keep(buf);
        ^^^

pchar_errors.pas:43:14: error: `KeepLater` keeps this PChar after it returns, which Ruscal can't do for a Char array (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#pchar-into-array
   KeepLater(buf);
             ^^^
